OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-vehicle crash shuts part of
OL,4,AA1(M)
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A1(M) has been closed after
OL,7,Fa multi-vehicle crash.
OL,9,FThe northbound carriageway has been
OL,10,Fshut at junction eight for Stevenage,
OL,11,FHertfordshire, National Highways said.
OL,13,FAll emergency services are on scene and
OL,14,Ftraffic is being diverted via the exit
OL,15,Fand entry slip roads, the roads agency
OL,16,Fadded.
OL,18,FDrivers are facing delays of up to 30
OL,19,Fminutes and three miles (4.8km) of
OL,20,Fcongestion.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
